    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225300/extras/17485f3b019f984ed36f79a7e4943dd6.avif?t=1753382197\" width=800 height=100 /></span><strong>Crypto Mining is an engaging simulator where you become a miner and build your own &quot;Crypto Empire.&quot; </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage cryptocurrency mining, optimize space, purchase equipment, and analyze the market. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take risks, expand your business, and prove that you are a master in the world of cryptocurrencies!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225300/extras/30f1cfc2ec05f0e30edb4936a3032943.avif?t=1753382197\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Order products directly from the manufacturer on the online market in order to get better performance.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225300/extras/a2fe264ff1ac774ed8531fd47a92e7c3.avif?t=1753382197\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy products on the market if you want to save money but also get worse performance.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225300/extras/130437331bfca0732e5c385755eebd2c.avif?t=1753382197\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For gambling, there is a casino on the PC, which has such modes as: 21 points, Dice.We wish you success in winning all the money in the world!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225300/extras/b3fbc99bbbcc67f615e053c81f2e0e6c.avif?t=1753382197\" width=800 height=100 /></span><strong>Trade large crypto-currency giants such as: NETCOIN,ETH,BTC.Keep an eye on the price chart, and exit the deal when it's profitable, just for you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225300/extras/16e84d054bd39e8e0f07777f126553e1.avif?t=1753382197\" width=800 height=100 /></span><strong>Feel like an adult, because you will have to pay the bills, or rather, for fines, for illegal mining, theft of goods, as well as for electricity!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225300/extras/b4192372c9b946e9f93f4884371f8429.avif?t=1753382197\" width=800 height=100 /></span><strong>Build RIGS according to your color and taste.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overclock your graphics card to get the best performance of your GPU!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Coming features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- VR!<br>- New Content!<br>- Online Mode!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225300/extras/17485f3b019f984ed36f79a7e4943dd6.avif?t=1753382197\" width=800 height=100 /></span><strong>Crypto Mining is an engaging simulator where you become a miner and build your own &quot;Crypto Empire.&quot; </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage cryptocurrency mining, optimize space, purchase equipment, and analyze the market. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take risks, expand your business, and prove that you are a master in the world of cryptocurrencies!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225300/extras/30f1cfc2ec05f0e30edb4936a3032943.avif?t=1753382197\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Order products directly from the manufacturer on the online market in order to get better performance.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225300/extras/a2fe264ff1ac774ed8531fd47a92e7c3.avif?t=1753382197\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy products on the market if you want to save money but also get worse performance.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225300/extras/130437331bfca0732e5c385755eebd2c.avif?t=1753382197\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For gambling, there is a casino on the PC, which has such modes as: 21 points, Dice.We wish you success in winning all the money in the world!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225300/extras/b3fbc99bbbcc67f615e053c81f2e0e6c.avif?t=1753382197\" width=800 height=100 /></span><strong>Trade large crypto-currency giants such as: NETCOIN,ETH,BTC.Keep an eye on the price chart, and exit the deal when it's profitable, just for you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225300/extras/16e84d054bd39e8e0f07777f126553e1.avif?t=1753382197\" width=800 height=100 /></span><strong>Feel like an adult, because you will have to pay the bills, or rather, for fines, for illegal mining, theft of goods, as well as for electricity!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225300/extras/b4192372c9b946e9f93f4884371f8429.avif?t=1753382197\" width=800 height=100 /></span><strong>Build RIGS according to your color and taste.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overclock your graphics card to get the best performance of your GPU!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Coming features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- VR!<br>- New Content!<br>- Online Mode!</strong></p>",
